<title>USA: Rock Is. Cty SD 40, Ill., won by Harris Trust.</title>
<headline>Rock Is. Cty SD 40, Ill., won by Harris Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust &amp; Savings Bank, said it won $8 million of Rock Island Cty SD 40, Ill., general obligation fire prevention and safety bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 4.60 percent.</p>
</text>
